# Pupil-level data never enters the repository (brief section 6): the survey
# response export and any school response data stay on the owner's machine.
# The build takes the export as an argument (see docs/SSS2026_ILR_Key_Documents_V4.15.md §3).
*response_export*.xlsx
*Response_Data*.xlsx
*YPD_export*.xlsx
inputs/*.xlsx
# Build outputs that are reproduced from this repository + the export (179 MB each):
generated/report.html
generated/*.report.json
generated/*.narrative-audit.csv
generated/*.qa.csv
generated/SSS2026_ILR_Report_*.html
# Rebuild-kit archives contain the export
SSS2026_ILR_Rebuild_Kit_*.zip
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
*.pyc
# V5.0: the cleansed dataset and the per-school exports written from it are input data
*.parquet
*cleansed_export*.xlsx
inputs/schools/
